              "start": 0,
              "end": 77,
              "quote": "去黄山让我想起披头士乐队的流行歌曲《漫长曲折的路》。这段经历最令人惊叹的，是那些超凡脱俗的景色。登上山顶后看到的翻滚云海，会让你意识到我们人类是多么渺小。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-grammar-fill-2",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:2"
              ],
              "start": 78,
              "end": 155,
              "quote": "山脚下的温泉是爬完山后一定要试试的。它无疑会帮你恢复精神！这温泉神奇的地方在于，气温越低，泉水就越热！很奇怪，是不是？可大自然就是这样，总让我们惊叹不已。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-grammar-fill-3",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:3"
              ],
              "start": 156,
              "end": 249,
              "quote": "接下来是没有尽头的一级级台阶。你会忍不住想，当年的人们要把这些石头一块块砌好该有多难。虽然它是上山路上唯一的人造之物，可它仍为整趟旅程增色不少，还提供了一个让你坐下来歇歇酸痛双腿的地方。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-grammar-fill-4",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:4"
              ],
              "start": 250,
              "end": 315,
              "quote": "正如歌里唱的，这条漫长曲折的路“永远不会消失”，它会一直留在游客的记忆里。在我的记忆里当然也是如此。你来中国的话，黄山是必去之地！"
            }
          ]
        },
        "completedSourceTexts": [
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:1",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:1",
            "text": "Going to Mount Huangshan reminds me of the popular Beatles’ song “The Long and Winding Road”. What is so breathtaking about the experience is the out-of-this-world scenes. The rolling sea of clouds you see once you are at the top will remind you how tiny we humans are."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:2",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:2",
            "text": "The hot spring at the foot of the mountain is something you must try after the climb. It will undoubtedly help you get refreshed! The amazing thing about the spring is that the colder the temperature gets, the hotter the spring! Strange, isn’t it? But that’s how nature is – always leaving us astonished."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:3",
            "text": "What comes next is the endless series of steps. You can’t help wondering how hard it was for the people then to put all those rocks into place. Though it is the only unnatural thing on your way up the mountain, still it highlights the whole adventure and offers a place where you can sit down to rest your aching legs."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-i:grammar-fill:4",
            "text": "As the song goes, this long and winding road “will never disappear”, and it will always stick in the visitor’s memory. It sure does in mine. While you’re in China, Mount Huangshan is a must to visit!"
          }
        ],
